    ["[ACADEMIC LECTURE - Botany]\nProfessor: Instead of performing photosynthesis, this unusual woodland plant obtains nutrients by parasitizing underground mycorrhizal fungi connected to nearby tree roots.", "How does the ghost plant obtain its nutrition?", ["By trapping forest insects in sticky leaves.", "By drawing nutrients from underground fungi linked to tree roots.", "By absorbing morning dew through its stem.", "By decomposing fallen autumn leaves directly."], 1, "Ia memperoleh nutrisi secara parasit dari jamur mikoriza bawah tanah yang terhubung ke akar pohon."],
    ["[ACADEMIC LECTURE - Botany]\nProfessor: ...obtains nutrients by parasitizing underground mycorrhizal fungi connected to nearby tree roots.", "What connects the underground fungi to surrounding trees?", ["Fallen branches.", "Tree roots.", "Rainwater puddles.", "Moss carpets."], 1, "Jamur mikoriza tersebut terhubung langsung dengan akar pohon di sekitarnya ('connected to nearby tree roots')."]
